        "TileImage": "$($repository bce38660-1554-425b-8a00-749b70b61015).Image",
        "Description": "Welcome to Providence, Agent 74 (formerly 47). As you may know, my name is Arthur Edwards. I will be your handler from now on.\r\rYour first assignment will be to mend my ill relationships with the partners. We can start with Alexa Carlisle. She knows Emma killed her brother, but also plans on killing her as well.\r\rI also have intel about a lawyer who has too much information on his hands regarding my whereabouts. Please cut off this loose end. \r\rDo avoid making a mess of her home.",
